+To enable HTTPS, provide both certificate paths and select the protocol:
+
+```yaml
+server:
+  protocol: https
+  cert_file: /etc/flipt/tls/server.crt
+  cert_key: /etc/flipt/tls/server.key
+```
+
+Flipt checks that both files exist during startup. The same TLS certificate is used by the REST API, UI, and gRPC server.
+
